<title>USA: Redwood Trust stake raised by group.</title>
<headline>Redwood Trust stake raised by group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>An investor group including Zweig-DiMenna Partners LP said Friday it raised its stake in Redwood Trust Inc to 1,241,500 common shares or 8.4 percent from 6.7 percent previously held.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include shares bought between August 8 and August 14 at prices ranging from $36.625 to $40.9286 per share.</p>
<p>Redwood, based in Mill Valley, Calif., is a Real Estate Investment Trust.</p>
